  "topic": "三分频繁施法诸葛亮",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "doc-b56b6d1307350f5b7bd334",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "前期（1-3回合）：拿一张弈星升二级，二级可以小搜保血，用孙尚香、蔡文姬、大乔、曹操、弈星等打工过渡。首轮拍卖优先级：刘禅 > 蔡文姬 > 大乔 > 马超。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 14,
          "paragraph_end": 14
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-307758f89fcd55a87e008e",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "三分阵容前期较弱，看情况凑人数保血量，蔡文姬可优先觉醒，可以提升全员等级，其余卡不必觉醒，留着能量升棋手四阶。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 4,
          "paragraph_end": 4
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-6b998cbc9e80e760482cc8",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "蔡文姬和三分英雄同时在手牌需要最先上场蔡文姬，再使用三分牌可以加等级；若大乔和其余登场英雄同时在手牌，需要先打出大乔，再打出登场英雄减蓝。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 5,
          "paragraph_end": 5
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-a0aaa36defb4af16c429f0",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "阵容速升棋手四阶找到诸葛亮。筹齐阵容后先不上棋手五阶，打合成，拉高等级，守血打连胜。遇到相同三分卡就合成，锦囊开出的三分英雄需要留着上场刷等级后再卖掉，蔡文姬会逐渐刷高全员等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 6,
          "paragraph_end": 6
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-b7f49a9e91ed36044e1262",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "稳住局势后需要升五拿人口，阵容需要一个打出位刷等级。遇到三分登场效果牌可以直接打出卖掉（甄姬、貂蝉、赵云、周瑜等，触发蔡文姬小乔加等级，蒙犽和庄周也是不错的选择）",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 7,
          "paragraph_end": 7
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c69d3e4c149ff2ddbf8582",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "中期（4-7回合）：速拉4级找核心。诸葛亮可换帅孙尚香，曹操同理。阵容成型后看情况打合成守血，稳住局势后需要升五，不然没有打出位刷等级。第二轮拍卖优先级：诸葛亮 > 小乔 > 甄姬 > 杨玉环。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 15,
          "paragraph_end": 15
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-900838d6c1479e973cd56b",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "上棋手五阶后遇吕布/周瑜优先获取，吕布决赛跳大 + 给诸葛亮吸血；周瑜前排又肉又控。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 8,
          "paragraph_end": 8
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-73e5e6cd9ecb1dc5ab5e40",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "后期（8回合之后）：主要任务是搜核心觉醒。遇到吕布和换帅可以留，决赛把蔡文姬/小乔的等级换帅给吕布，大决战也可以补太乙真人保证容错。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 16,
          "paragraph_end": 16
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-d6108b0625b9df118ad0d0",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "诸葛亮：魔律之刃、自然法杖、贤者之书",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-5f63a85f9d0365a81033cb",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "大乔：法源之杯等回蓝装。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 11,
          "paragraph_end": 11
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-5f92c61f6b8bb31083ac50",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "刘禅：优先提升坦度，霸者重铠，不祥征兆等肉装。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 12,
          "paragraph_end": 12
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-720162a32afa1bdabdb50d",
      "section": "定阵条件",
      "text": "材料没有明确绑定棋手，本篇只保存已讲清的阵容共通操作；棋手专属技能与升级差异待确认，不把正文提及的英雄当成棋手。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-052102d2da67f4e6b06b74e8d95ef9fa09a1b33b596a0ab71f5027b8166875a1",
          "paragraph_start": 14,
          "paragraph_end": 14
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-4cfbc1950702ca17decb48",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "材料已给出的棋手升级操作按前、中、后期执行；未明确各中间等阶的独立找牌目标、停留边界或六阶后资源安排时，仍待确认。升级前同时比较当前战力、掉血风险、核心与觉醒进度，以及升级后买牌预算；不能仅因到达某回合就忽略保命战力。",
      "version": null,
